  "releaseNotes": "v2.2.0 - Added net10.0 target framework (multi-targets net9.0 and net10.0). Added NuGet package README.\nv2.1.0 - Added Register, ChangePassword, ForgotPassword, ResetPassword, ConfirmEmail pages. Added admin User List and Edit User pages with role/claim management and account lockout. Added NoOpCosmosIdentityEmailSender, token providers, and CosmosIdentityAdmin authorization policy.\nv2.0.0 - BREAKING: AddCosmosIdentity() moved to core Benday.Identity.CosmosDb package. Use AddCosmosIdentityWithUI() for the full UI experience. CosmosIdentityOptions and CosmosIdentitySeeder also moved to core package.",
